config BR2_PACKAGE_LINUX_SMP
	bool "linux-smp"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  The kernel of rv32-nexysa7100 built with several harts, ie: the
	  defines CPU_COUNT=2 and ATOMIC_COHERENCE=1: the sources and patches
	  of the package linux, its configuration linux.config merged with
	  linux-smp.config; its Image is installed to images/smp/.

comment "linux-smp needs the Linux kernel"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
